==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Mienshao|70}} from the {{TCG|Noble Victories}} expansion.
*'''Spiral Kick''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Unseen Forces|Hitmontop|26}} from the {{TCG|EX Unseen Forces}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

